  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37878710",
      "title": "Different Version - Different Image",
      "sourceHash": "b1657454ec5d88d57320270af97c7ddacf3eca4e1cae4bd2f5148e49712d2642",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "Before we dive into the prompting part of this module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "I wanna have a quick look at Midjourney's versions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 12.66,
          "en": "because after Version 4, Version 5 was introduced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.66,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "and came with some very important changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "For example, Version 5 can display",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "more realistic individuals, and they fixed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 24.84,
          "en": "important things connected to that, like for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.84,
          "end": 26.79,
          "en": "they fixed the finger count.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.79,
          "end": 30.27,
          "en": "Individuals now typically have five fingers per hand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 31.773,
          "en": "and not six or more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "So Version 5 or newer are the most advanced models",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 38.88,
          "en": "Midjourney offers now and I also recommend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.88,
          "end": 42.3,
          "en": "to get started at least with Version 5.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.3,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "However, Midjourney continuously improves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 47.7,
          "en": "the image generation model and therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 51.21,
          "en": "with the latest version, we get even sharper images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.21,
          "end": 53.16,
          "en": "and more details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.16,
          "end": 56.79,
          "en": "This latest version now is called Version 5.1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.79,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "At the point in time when you're watching this video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "there might be an even newer version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.65,
          "en": "So 5.1 is the most advanced version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.65,
          "end": 67.983,
          "en": "but it is displayed here in a different line on the slide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "This has a reason, because Version 5.1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 75.24,
          "en": "is a so-called opinionated model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.24,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "Midjourney's goal is to make image creation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 79.62,
          "en": "as easy as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.62,
          "end": 82.8,
          "en": "Therefore, such an opinionated model simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 87.8,
          "en": "that the AI executes ideas based on short term prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 90.45,
          "en": "So you could say that the AI is more creative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.45,
          "end": 93.03,
          "en": "and tries to understand what you're looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.03,
          "end": 96.50999999999999,
          "en": "This is actually great and we will also use Version 5.1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.50999999999999,
          "end": 101.00999999999999,
          "en": "in this module now because 5.1 is also the default model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.00999999999999,
          "end": 103.5,
          "en": "used in Midjourney at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 105.45,
          "en": "But if you want to be more explicit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.45,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "about what should be displayed on the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "if you don't want the AI to come up with creative ideas,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 115.68,
          "en": "instead you want to define all the details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.68,
          "end": 117.93299999999999,
          "en": "that should be part of the image on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.89,
          "end": 122.85,
          "en": "then you can also jump back to an unopinionated model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.85,
          "end": 125.853,
          "en": "which requires more detailed prescriptions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.93,
          "end": 130.5,
          "en": "Unopinionated models are Version 4 and 5. for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.5,
          "end": 133.773,
          "en": "As mentioned, I recommend Version 5 or newer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.64,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "However, if you wanna have the latest model changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 141.42000000000002,
          "en": "the latest updates or sharper images, more details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 144.93,
          "en": "and so on that were introduced with Version 5.1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.93,
          "end": 148.05,
          "en": "but you want to have an unopinionated model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.05,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "then you can also use Version 5.1 Raw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 155.1,
          "en": "So depending on your use case, this might be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.1,
          "end": 157.29,
          "en": "the best of both worlds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.29,
          "end": 160.26,
          "en": "So you have the latest Midjourney model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.26,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "in an unopinionated way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 165.03,
          "en": "So you provide all the details about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.03,
          "end": 166.89,
          "en": "what should be displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 170.91,
          "en": "As mentioned, in this module, we'll use Version 5.1 now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.91,
          "end": 173.88,
          "en": "because in my opinion it works really great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "Still, I'm gonna give you one example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 179.34,
          "en": "about the different outcomes that you get with the different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.34,
          "end": 182.613,
          "en": "versions based on this quite simple prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 186.27,
          "en": "I just wanna have a photo of an elephant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.27,
          "end": 188.133,
          "en": "walking through the desert.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.21,
          "end": 192.39,
          "en": "This is Version 4, and it doesn't look too bad",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.39,
          "end": 197.31,
          "en": "in my opinion, but it obviously lacks a lot of details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "The desert looks very generic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 203.253,
          "en": "You can immediately see that this is a generated image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.21,
          "end": 207.57,
          "en": "With Version 5, things changed significantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.57,
          "end": 211.86,
          "en": "Version 5 now renders very realistically looking images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.86,
          "end": 213.45,
          "en": "in my opinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.45,
          "end": 215.7,
          "en": "The desert is a lot more detailed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 217.68,
          "en": "and this could be a real photo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.68,
          "end": 219.603,
          "en": "if you look at it at first sight.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 222.997,
          "en": "With Version 5.1 Raw, which is the next example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.997,
          "end": 226.82999999999998,
          "en": "now we get even more details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.82999999999998,
          "end": 229.07999999999998,
          "en": "We get more vibrant colors at first sight",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.07999999999998,
          "end": 231.32999999999998,
          "en": "so this could be a bit too artificial",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 233.31,
          "en": "depending on what you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.31,
          "end": 237.03,
          "en": "But the desert looks very realistic in my opinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.03,
          "end": 239.94,
          "en": "It comes with a lot of details, great shadows,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.94,
          "end": 242.013,
          "en": "same thing applies to the elephant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.66,
          "end": 247.08,
          "en": "Finally, Version 5.1, not in the Raw version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.08,
          "end": 251.64,
          "en": "created this here, also very detailed in my opinion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.64,
          "end": 253.08,
          "en": "a great looking elephant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.08,
          "end": 255.45,
          "en": "Lots of awesome shadows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.45,
          "end": 257.97,
          "en": "In this specific example here, personally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 257.97,
          "end": 262.5,
          "en": "I think that 5.1 Raw creates the better images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.5,
          "end": 265.65,
          "en": "But as mentioned, this obviously depends on the prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.65,
          "end": 267.75,
          "en": "and what you want to display.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.75,
          "end": 271.08,
          "en": "So for this module, we'll stick to Version 5.1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.08,
          "end": 274.86,
          "en": "and I can tell you already we will create amazing images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.86,
          "end": 276.48,
          "en": "with this version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.48,
          "end": 279.15,
          "en": "For your personal projects and to play around,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 279.15,
          "end": 281.88,
          "en": "you can also have a look at Version 5.1 Raw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 281.88,
          "end": 284.343,
          "en": "or Version 5 if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 285.42,
          "end": 288.75,
          "en": "So this is what the models are all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 288.75,
          "end": 293.67,
          "en": "We'll now select Version 5.1 as mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 293.67,
          "end": 296.1,
          "en": "so you can check your settings and then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.1,
