          "en": "make sure that 5.1 is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 299.22,
          "end": 303.75,
          "en": "5.1 is also the default model used in Midjourney now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.75,
